{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08（20秒）、S11（22秒）、S12（25秒）等短时段的信息仍然偏密，容易来不及扫完；另外S09把想有人陪进一步解释成愿意再受气，比X的表达更武断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点放大和话语分行，让观众不用读完所有句子就能抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么产生转变；感受又与音乐段落同步出现，不必一次消化整堆短词。尤其在怀念、抗拒、孤独、重新站稳之间，Y把情绪变化和音乐细节联系得更具体，前后也更容易形成一条完整的心理发展线。它的主要代价是部分短时段信息密度偏高，个别心理解释也稍显过度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b7b0d43b-492f-4841-8743-29422e75329e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182142188571Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:23:11.961380+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e8bf4d22b305731bd086c922f940d85441b7b621c77ed4e0db9339a7defe6159", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\